{"product":{"id":9697331052850,"title":"Bogota Baby","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eColombia has been such a go-to Single. We are proud of the flavours that translate in this. That body of a Colombian with caramels and sugars that are best enjoyed black or with less milk.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eOrigin: Colombia\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eFarm: Gaitania, Planadas municipality\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eProcess method: Fully Washed\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eVarietal: Caturra, Typica\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eScore: +86\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eTasting notes: Clean, stone fruit, balanced acidity\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eBrew: Espresso, French press, Stovetop, Cold Brew\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eRecipe:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eEspresso\u003c\/u\u003e: 1:1.85 grams-in-to-grams-out over 30 seconds. For a short black, we suggest 1:1 ratio for a sweeter smoother double ristretto.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ePlunger\u003c\/u\u003e: we recommend pre heating vessel with hot water, then weighing grams in (we suggest starting with 15g) and steeping for 4min with one agitation in the beginning. Then press and pour out all contents into another vessel. Adjust grams as to your liking.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Hark Coffee","product_type":"","created_at":"2024-11-14T17:52:48+10:30","handle":"bogota-baby","updated_at":"2026-08-31T16:47:39+09:30","published_at":"2024-11-14T17:52:54+10:30","template_suffix":"bogota-baby","published_scope":"global","tags":"aeropress, batch brew, build-box, coffee, cold brew, espresso, french press, medium, plunger, single origin, stove top","variants":[{"id":49536556400946,"product_id":9697331052850,"title":"400g \/ Whole Beans","price":"40.00","sku":"","position":1,"compare_at_price"